---
title: Anime — Dixita Ganatra
layout: main
---
<article class='page content-list anime-page'>
  <header class='page-header anime-header'>
    <h1>Anime I’m watching / have watched.</h1>
    <p>I mostly watch anime in Japanese, but I prefer the English dub when I want something to watch casually while doing something else.</p>
  </header>

  <div class='anime-filters' role='group' aria-label='Filter anime'>
    <button
      class='blog-filter is-active'
      type='button'
      data-anime-filter='all'
      aria-pressed='true'
    >
      All
    </button>
    <button
      class='blog-filter'
      type='button'
      data-anime-filter='favorites'
      aria-pressed='false'
    >
      Favorites
    </button>
    <button class='blog-filter' type='button' data-anime-filter='series' aria-pressed='false'>
      Seasons
    </button>
    <button class='blog-filter' type='button' data-anime-filter='film' aria-pressed='false'>
      Movies
    </button>
  </div>
  <p class='anime-empty' id='anime-filter-empty' role='status' hidden>
    No titles in this view yet.
  </p>

  <div class='anime-sections'>
    <section class='anime-watching' aria-labelledby='watching-heading'>
      <h2 class='content-section-heading' id='watching-heading'>Watching now</h2>
      {% if anime.watching.size > 0 %}
        <ul class='anime-list'>
          {% for entry in anime.watching %}
            {% include 'anime-entry' %}
          {% endfor %}
        </ul>
      {% else %}
        <p class='anime-empty'>Nothing here just yet.</p>
      {% endif %}
    </section>

    <section class='anime-archive' aria-labelledby='watched-heading'>
      <div class='anime-archive__heading'>
        <h2 class='content-section-heading' id='watched-heading'>Watched</h2>
      </div>
      {% if anime.watched.size > 0 %}
        {% assign watched_years = anime.watched | entriesByNewestYear %}
        {% for year_titles in watched_years %}
          <section class='anime-year' aria-labelledby='anime-year-{{ year_titles[0] }}'>
            <h3 id='anime-year-{{ year_titles[0] }}'>{{ year_titles[0] }}</h3>
            <ul class='anime-list watched-anime'>
              {% for entry in year_titles[1] %}
                {% include 'anime-entry' %}
              {% endfor %}
            </ul>
          </section>
        {% endfor %}
      {% else %}
        <p class='anime-empty'>The collection is on its way.</p>
      {% endif %}
    </section>
  </div>
</article>
